Z||000000||87FieroGTx||08-01-2001||08:16 AM|||| I'm going to the bone yard tomarow and was wondering what Wheels/spoilers will bolt onto a 85 Fiero GT?||||reg||1
Z||000001||KRMFiero||08-01-2001||08:58 AM||||do a search for "wheel fit" or somthing, try a few things you will find lists several pages long.<P>as for the spoiler i dont belive that any aftermarket/other car spoiler looks good on a Fiero other then the Original one, all years should fit. maybe a Trans am spoiler or something will, wont look as good, the Fiero spoiler is huge, BTW if you add a spoiler to your car you will need to upgrade your spings too<P>Kyle||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroLisa||08-01-2001||11:01 AM||||there is somewhere a huge list of wheels that will fit on a fiero... but just to name a few um lumina, cavalier, sunbird, grand am...  as for spoilers, i cant think of any that would look good on a gt. i had a trans am spoiler on my coupe and loved it though.||||reg||1
